#RingCtrl9 

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB : Autonomous Emergency Braking
#GVT : Global Vehicle Target
#VUT : Vehicle Under Test
#FCW : Forward Collision Warning
#CCRb : Car-to-Car Rear, Braking GVT
#
#This example is based on a test scenario published by Euro NCAP for AEB systems. The target (GVT) is moving at 50 km/h and decelerates at 6 m/s^2. The VUT is trailing with a distance of 12 m.
#
#The GVT speed is defined with an output parameter Vx_GVT that can be set as a constant or managed with an equation.
#
#Set START_DISTANCE in the Misc. yellow field on the Run Control screen.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

